 "description": "Call Lens decodes supported token-call shapes locally and compares the recipient, spender and atomic amount with your expectations. It distinguishes ERC-20 allowances from ERC-721 token IDs using the declared standard. It never connects a wallet or evaluates contract safety. No chain simulation, malicious-contract detection, token identity lookup, balance inspection or safety verdict. Retrieve calls with fetch or read its example resource to obtain exact inputs. Parameters are processed remotely without application persistence.",
